Description: Visible Ephemeris — satellite tracker with Qt dashboards
 Visible Ephemeris tracks Earth-orbiting satellites in real time (SGP4 or
 High-Precision Orbit Propagator), classifies optical visibility, predicts
 passes, and serves telemetry via a web dashboard, HTTP text mirror, and TCP
 physics stream. This package ships the Python tracker plus three PyQt6
 dashboards:
  * ve-ide                  VS Code-style IDE panel for the project
  * ve-orbital-architect-qt Satellite fleet selection GUI
  * ve-hpop-panel           Real-time physics-stream diagnostic panel
 The CLI tracker (ve-tracker) is also installed. All dashboards are launched
 from the applications menu or by name from a shell.
